WEBVTT

1
00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:02.450
For marketplaces. The Shopping Agent on Your Side.

2
00:00:02.500 --> 00:00:06.450
Shoppers will ask agents. Keep the ask in your app. Two ways in: embedded, the agent in your product; or hosted, run on our platform under your brand.

3
00:00:06.500 --> 00:00:13.450
Embedded, in the brightcart app. The agent inside your app. A customer asks the brightcart app for a quiet kettle under $80. The agent: three brightcart sellers have one, this one arrives Thursday. $69 from Brewline, checkout in brightcart. Your app and checkout. Our agent and checks.

4
00:00:13.500 --> 00:00:20.450
Hosted, Mini-Stores for brightcart sellers. Stores for your sellers, hosted by us. A Brewline Mini-Store, published under the brightcart brand. A shopper’s agent from outside asks for a kettle under $80, and Brewline has one. A pantrybox Mini-Store in draft. We host them. Your sellers meet outside agents.

5
00:00:20.500 --> 00:00:25.450
Two paths. Different jobs. Embedded: you run the app, we run the agent. Hosted: we run the stores, your brand on them. Start with one. Add the other.

6
00:00:25.500 --> 00:00:29.950
Discovery stays with you. You keep the customer, and your checkout. Sellers compared on facts, never on fees. No paid ranking, for anyone.

7
00:00:30.000 --> 00:00:32.450
Safe, Fast, Fun!

8
00:00:32.500 --> 00:00:36.450
The Shopping Agent on Your Side. Talk to Partnerships.
